  "verification_notes": {
    "rate_limits": "已核实(rate-limits.md):语言模型仅RPM/TPM限速,无并发(inflight)限制;主子账号共享限额。M3: rpm20/tpm1M(free), rpm200/tpm10M(paid); M2.7系列(含M2.5/M2.1/M2及highspeed): rpm20/tpm1M(free), rpm500/tpm20M(paid)。口径=rpm_tpm(与Kimi同,与DeepSeek/智谱的concurrency不同)",
    "pricing_m3": "已核实(pricing-paygo.md):M3永久五折,按输入是否>512K分段,另按service_tier分standard/priority(priority=标准价1.5倍)。划线原价:standard≤512K input4.20/output16.80/cache_read0.84; 五折后2.10/8.40/0.42。>512K档为≤512K档×2",
    "pricing_m2x": "已核实:M2.7标准版input2.10/output8.40/cache_read0.42/cache_write2.625;highspeed变体input/output为标准版×2(4.20/16.80),cache_read/cache_write不变。历史模型M2.5/M2.1/M2的cache_read=0.21(标准版),其余同M2.7",
    "deprecated_models": "已核实(models-intro.md):M2.5/M2.5-highspeed/M2.1/M2.1-highspeed/M2 位于'历史模型'折叠面板,标status=deprecated;M2-her在模型概览与定价页均未出现,标status=deprecated(下线)",
    "thinking_mode": "已核实(openapi):thinking.type取值disabled/adaptive,默认adaptive。M3支持disabled(可关思考);M2.x系列始终开启思考不可disable → 对齐验证'思考开关'项对M2.x判SKIP(无法关闭对比)",
    "service_tier": "已核实:service_tier取值standard/priority,默认standard;priority=标准价1.5倍,影响定价对齐,验证时须注明档位",
    "protocols": "已核实(models-intro.md):所有文本模型API链接统一指向text-anthropic-api,即Anthropic兼容接口为主;同时支持OpenAI兼容(/v1)。M3在Anthropic API下支持interleaved thinking",
    "max_tokens_field": "已核实:max_tokens已弃用,用max_completion_tokens替代;M3 recommended131072/max524288,M2.x recommended65536/max204800"
  },
